silm:instances_papers_15_chapters_05_sections_01_concrete_anchor_1#bodymasserroneous4_3kg silm:hasLongDescription "The BodyMassErroneous4_3kg is the uncalibrated 4.3 kg reading from stage n. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Value^erroneous_n', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
